<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Thibron</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/322-bce">322 BCE</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/4th-century-bce">4th century BCE</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Thibron was a Spartan <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mercenary">mercenary</a> commander who, after murdering Harpalus in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/crete">Crete</a> in 324 BCE, took over his mercenary army and crossed to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cyrenaica">Cyrenaica</a>. He fought Cyrene and its neighbours for control of the region until <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ophellas">Ophellas</a>, sent by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ptolemy-i-soter">Ptolemy I</a>, defeated him in 322 BCE. He was captured and executed, and Cyrene came under Ptolemaic rule.</p></div>
